chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "Mining and Consensus"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the book's own source at tag third_edition_print1. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-10-15T11:58:34Z; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.4." ;
    res:hasResearchScope chx:Scope ; rdfs:member chx:P01, chx:P02, chx:P03, chx:P04, chx:P05, chx:P06, chx:P07, chx:P08, chx:P09, chx:P10, chx:P11, chx:P12, chx:P13, chx:P14, chx:P15, chx:P16, chx:P17, chx:P18, chx:P19, chx:P20, chx:P21, chx:P22, chx:P23, chx:P24, chx:P25, chx:P26, chx:P27, chx:P28, chx:P29, chx:P30, chx:P31, chx:P32, chx:P33, chx:P34, chx:P35, chx:P36, chx:P37, chx:P38, chx:P39, chx:P40, chx:P41, chx:P42, chx:P43, chx:P44, chx:P45, chx:P46, chx:P47, chx:P48, chx:P49, chx:P50, chx:P51, chx:P52, chx:P53, chx:P54, chx:P55, chx:P56, chx:P57, chx:P58, chx:P59, chx:P60, chx:P61, chx:P62, chx:P63, chx:P64, chx:P65, chx:P66, chx:P67, chx:P68, chx:P69, chx:P70, chx:P71, chx:P72, chx:P73, chx:P74, chx:P75, chx:P76, chx:P77, chx:P78, chx:P79, chx:P80, chx:P81, chx:P82, chx:P83, chx:P84, chx:P85, chx:P86, chx:P87, chx:P88, chx:P89, chx:P90, chx:P91 .
chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does Chapter 12 of Mastering Bitcoin (3rd edition) say about the creation of money by mining, the independent verification of blocks, the proof of work with its target and retargeting, mining pools, attacks on the hash rate and the changing of consensus rules by hard and soft forks, which of its statements can be recomputed or run on Bitcoin Core 31.1 and on real blocks of the main chain, and what has changed in Bitcoin Core, the BIPs and the mining market since the book went to print?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-15." .
